{'symbol': 'SPG', 'date': '2021-03-23 09:00:00', 'title': 'MICHELE WALTON PROMOTED TO SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, GENERAL COUNSEL FOR THE TAUBMAN COMPANY', 'text': "BLOOMFIELD HILLS, MICH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE TAUBMAN COMPANY LLC (“TAUBMAN”) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MICHELE WALTON HAS BEEN PROMOTED TO SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, GENERAL COUNSEL REPORTING TO CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER ROBERT S. TAUBMAN. IN HER ROLE, WALTON IS RESPONSIBLE FOR ALL LEGAL AFFAIRS AND FUNCTIONS, AND SERVES AS A MEMBER OF THE COMPANY'S OPERATING COMMITTEE. “MICHELE HAS HAD AN IMPRESSIVE CAREER TRAJECTORY DURING HER 10 YEARS AT TAUBMAN,” SAID ROBERT TAUBMAN. “SHE IS A WELL-RESPE"}